OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of homes without water
OL,4,Adue to burst main
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 3,000 properties still have no
OL,7,Fwater 16 hours after a water main
OL,8,Fburst.
OL,10,FThe incident near Bath in Somerset
OL,11,Fhappened at about 02:00 GMT and is
OL,12,Faffecting houses in the BA2, BA3 and
OL,13,FBS39 areas of Paulton, Temple Cloud and
OL,14,FClutton.
OL,16,FBristol Water said its crews were
OL,17,Frecharging the network to restore
OL,18,Fsupplies to the 3,000 homes - but added
OL,19,Fthat this needed to be done in a
OL,20,Fcontrolled way.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
