OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of homes without water
OL,4,Adue to burst main
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the supplier said a
OL,7,Fbottled water hub at Tesco Superstore
OL,8,Fin Paulton was open and it was looking
OL,9,Fto open a second water station as a
OL,10,Fprecaution.
